# Scoped ignore for the documentation image build (build context = repo root).
# Keep .md sources, .vuepress/, backend/ and packages/branding/ (for schema:print
# + SpectaQL — the backend imports the branding package); drop
# the heavy build artifacts and installed deps so the context stays small.
**/node_modules
.git
**/build
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.nuxt
.vuepress/.cache
.vuepress/.temp
.vuepress/dist
.vuepress/public/api
cypress/videos
cypress/screenshots
cypress/reports
deployment/configurations
**/*.log
release
.env
**/.env
# Design/concept scratch (not in the site nav / SUMMARY.md, often WIP and not valid
# VuePress markdown). Keeps the local build in parity with CI, which only has
# committed files.
docu
# …but docu/gitbook/ holds the SCREENSHOTS the published pages embed, and vite fails
# hard on a missing asset rather than warning: "Could not load
# /repo/docu/gitbook/graphql-playground.png (imported by …/backend/index.html.vue)".
# Eight images across backend/, cypress/ and webapp/ READMEs resolve here; the folder
# contains no markdown, so nothing WIP comes back in with them. 4.5 MB of the 21 MB.
!docu/gitbook
